    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark forensic aesthetic, disciplined cyan/amber accents, and a commanding headline. Desktop composition feels polished, but the oversized empty upper-right area weakens balance. Tablet and especially mobile become excessively tall and dense; tables, metadata, and labels shrink to near-illegibility, while the mobile header visibly truncates navigation. The repeated bordered panels also flatten hierarchy below the primary metrics.",
